\section{Two reasons this is not the size of the project}{


\strong{It over-reports compressed files.} PRIDE frequently gives the *decompressed* size - the
MGF in PXD000001 reports 16,448,103 bytes and downloads as 5,984,662, a factor of \strong{2.75}.

\strong{It sums an incomplete manifest.} For PXD000001 this returns \strong{0.51 GB}; the project on
disk is \strong{1.44 GB}, because PRIDE's API omits five files including the two largest (see
\code{\link{pride_list_files}}).

The two errors run in opposite directions and do \strong{not} cancel: compressed sizes are
inflated, whole files are missing entirely.
}
